  triage:title "run-hermes-graft-smoke.py sends requires_ack=False then calls atm ack, rejected as not-pending" ;
  triage:description "fenix (ATM 01M2ANEESW1KSCS1J697J8E8MA, 2026-09-12T11:18:37Z), found during 1.5.16 local smoke (graft-hermes lane). scripts/phase-ai/run-hermes-graft-smoke.py sent its marker with requires_ack=False and then ran `atm ack`, which failed with \"not pending acknowledgement\" -- enforced since d08647e92 (pre-Phase-BA), the script predates that enforcement change. Fixed in PR #1428 (fix/phase-ba-smoke-graft-ack) at 3bc6122b4, one-line fix. Minor; does not block 1.5.16." ;
